.TH DIFFSTREAM 1 "2026-11-24" "diffstream-tools 1.0.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
diffstream \- XFS and Btrfs reflink extent diff & universal stream apply utility
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B diffstream
\-\-diff [--base file] --change file [\-\-truncate size] [\-\-nocache] [\-v]
.br
.B diffstream
\-\-apply \-\-target file_or_dev [\-\-nocache] [\-\-noresize] [\-\-taildiscard]
.br
.B diffstream
[--base file] --change file \-\-target file_or_dev [\-\-truncate size] [\-\-nocache] [\-\-noresize] [\-\-taildiscard] [\-v]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B diffstream
computes block-level differences via FS_IOC_FIEMAP and emits or applies a wire-compatible
.B DIFFSTR1
stream (OP_TRUNCATE, OP_DATA, OP_HOLE, OP_EOF).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-diff
Emit a binary DIFFSTR1 delta stream to stdout.
.TP
.B \-\-apply
Read a DIFFSTR1 stream from stdin and apply to \fB\-\-target\fR.
.TP
.BI \-\-base " src"
Baseline snapshot (if omitted, emits full sparse-aware stream including OP_HOLE packets for unmapped regions).
.TP
.BI \-\-change " src"
Modified snapshot to diff.
.TP
.BI \-\-target " dst"
Destination file, LV, ZVOL, or block device.
.TP
.B \-\-nocache
Drop page cache pages via sync_file_range(2) and posix_fadvise(2).
.TP
.B \-\-noresize
Do not resize target on OP_TRUNCATE (required for fixed block devices). Fails if target < source.
.TP
.B \-\-taildiscard
With \fB\-\-noresize\fR, discard/zero trailing bytes past source EOF via BLKZEROOUT or FALLOC_FL_PUNCH_HOLE.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Print transfer statistics to stderr.
.TP
.BI \-\-truncate " size"
Clamp source stream size to \fIsize\fR (supports K/M/G/T suffixes) for V2P migration onto smaller disks.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B Local one-command sync:
diffstream --base snap1.img --change snap2.img --target /backup/vm.img --nocache -v
.TP
.B Remote reflink backup over Zstd + SSH:
diffstream --diff --base snap1.img --change snap2.img --nocache -v | zstd -T0 | ssh backup-host "zstd -d | diffstream --apply --target /srv/backups/vm.img --nocache"
.TP
.B V2P migration of a shrunk 100G VM image onto an 80G NVMe drive:
diffstream --diff --change shrunk_100g.img --truncate 80G --nocache -v | diffstream --apply --target /dev/nvme0n1 --noresize --taildiscard --nocache
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR thindiffstream (1),
.BR zfsdiffstream (1),
.BR blkstream (1)
